to put my car in neutral.

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:24.530
We had a driveway that went down,

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:25.980
put my car in neutral in
the middle of the night,

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:30.450
coast down, parents never knew
when I came home, you know.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:32.800
But, they would be like,
"What'd you do last night?"

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:34.411
And I'm like, "Oh, I went
out with duh-duh-duh-duh."

00:10:34.411 --> 00:10:38.810
But they would be like,
it would be all bad,

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.313
if they had wanted to do that.

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.662
Yeah, I know they were totally repressed

00:10:43.662 --> 00:10:48.662
and like, I mean, but I
know the wild was in them.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:53.893
But yeah, I don't know, I just think

00:10:53.893 --> 00:10:56.360
in the end it makes you
unhappy if you can't do

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:58.070
what you want to do and
be who you want to be.

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:58.950
- [Interviewer] Absolutely.

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:01.830
- You know, I mean, I
can't say I'm unhappy

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.180
with myself or anybody else.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.343
Like, things are good.

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:09.260
So I can't complain.

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:10.093
- [Interviewer] That's great.

00:11:10.093 --> 00:11:11.090
- Uh huh.

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:12.199
- [Interviewer] All right, Alanna.

00:11:12.199 --> 00:11:13.270
Thank you so much for talking with me.

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:14.790
And good luck.

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:15.623
- Thanks.

00:11:15.623 --> 00:11:16.938
- [Interviewer] With
whatever you end up doing

00:11:16.938 --> 00:11:18.600
- Thanks.
- [Interviewer] From here.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:20.013
Okay, thank you.

